<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-dignor</span></b> , ātus,
		1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a.
				dep., to reject as unworthy, to disdain, scorn, refuse</i>
			(most freq. in Ov.; perh. not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With two <i>accs.</i>: quos ego sim toties jam dedignata maritos, *
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				A. 4, 536</span></i>; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aliquem maritum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					H. 16, 195</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virum, Pelasgum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 12, 83</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">comitem amicum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Pont. 1, 7, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Philippum patrem ( = abdicare),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					6, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nec dedignanda carmina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					13, 538</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With <i>inf.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magni genibus procumbere non est Dedignata
					Jovis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 13, 586</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				F. 4, 36</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Pont. 2, 2,
			79</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Curt. 10, 5, 33</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 2, 34
					<i>fin.</i></span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(g).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">accendebat dedignantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					2, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
